description = "When Pike breaks her Beloved's line of sight she vanishes: invisible to every enemy and 20% faster, even back in plain view, until she attacks or casts anything but There You Are. Her first knife out of hiding deals double damage and roots for 0.75 s (at most once per 6 s)."
